{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab object, check properties, and perform specific task. Scan area and move if no object is visible. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = Move    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />\"",
